<%# Engine-owned layout classes for the admin pages (admin overview, contracts
    index, audit trail), scoped under the .cs- prefix like the public
    catalogue's stylesheet (shared/_public_styles).

    Why not Tailwind utilities or inline styles: the host compiles its CSS
    once, at image build time, from whatever classes its content scan saw
    then, and Decidim's admin views carry no flex-wrap / gap-y classes — so
    the button rows these pages need cannot be built from the host bundle
    (docs/public-ui.md). Named classes keep the markup free of inline styles
    and let anyone restyle them.

    Delivery: the admin layout has no :css_content slot (that is the public
    layout's); it displays Decidim's :head snippets, so the block is added
    there — once per request, however many partials nest. Where no snippet
    registry exists (the dummy harness) the block renders in place.

    Override points:
      1. Host or other modules can target the classes from their own CSS.
         Selectors are single classes (no ids, no !important), so any plain
         rule of equal or later order wins.
      2. A host app can replace this whole partial by placing a file at the
         same view path (app/views/decidim/contracts_sk/shared/
         _admin_styles.html.erb) — Rails prefers host views over engine
         views.

    Classes:
      .cs-admin-actions  header action buttons (side by side, never wrapping,
                         pushed right, no shrinking inside .item_show__header)
      .cs-admin-chips    wrapping rows of chip/filter buttons with a gap
      .cs-admin-more     breathing room above a "show all" button
      .cs-admin-hint     small top margin for a hint line under a button row
      .cs-admin-notes    the notes list (ordered, no bullets)
      .cs-admin-note     one internal review note (author line + body)
      .cs-admin-note-meta  a note's author (strong) and time, wrapping on narrow screens
      .cs-admin-note-body  a note's text: newlines kept, long words wrapped
      .cs-admin-note-visibility  the muted "internal only" line above the thread
      .cs-admin-note-form  the append form: label above a full-width textarea
      .cs-admin-rules    a readable bulleted rules/problems list (the bundle strips list styles)
      .cs-admin-search   the role-grant user search: label above a full-width field (#112)
      .cs-admin-role-actions  a row of per-role button_to forms in a table actions cell (wraps)
      .cs-admin-roles    the role tables: left-aligned like a list of people, not centred
      .cs-admin-dangling  a target that no longer resolves: dark red, bold (the bundle's text-warning yellow is 1.7:1)
      .cs-admin-sr-only  visually hidden text for screen readers (the bundle has no show-for-sr)
      .cs-admin-import   the import preview table: left-aligned, tabular line numbers,
                         right-aligned amounts (__num) and per-row error lists (__errors)
      .cs-admin-template-note     muted explanatory line on the template pages and the new-contract chooser
      .cs-admin-template-section  the small heading above a group of template fields or choices
      .cs-admin-choice--idle      an unselected option in a one-of chooser (outlined; the current one stays solid
                                  — the bundle renders button__primary red, which reads as danger)
      .cs-admin-templates         the templates table: left-aligned, actions in one wrapping row
      .cs-admin-template-name     a template's name in the list (heavier, long names wrap)
      .cs-admin-template-ico      the muted IČO beside the object party in the list
      .cs-admin-template-none     the muted "no party" placeholder in the list %>
<% unless @cs_admin_styles_rendered %>
  <% @cs_admin_styles_rendered = true %>
  <% css = capture do %>
<style>
  .cs-admin-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: auto; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .cs-admin-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .cs-admin-more { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .cs-admin-hint { margin-top: .5rem; }
  .cs-admin-notes { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; max-width: 72ch; }
  .cs-admin-note { padding: .875rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, .1); }
  .cs-admin-note:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  .cs-admin-note-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: .25rem .75rem; margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
  .cs-admin-note-meta time { font-size: .875rem; color: #3e4c5c; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cs-admin-note-body { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; line-height: 1.5; }
  .cs-admin-note-visibility { margin: 0; font-size: .875rem; color: #3e4c5c; }
  .cs-admin-note-form { max-width: 72ch; }
  .cs-admin-note-form label { display: block; }
  .cs-admin-template-note { margin: .75rem 0 0; font-size: .875rem; color: #3e4c5c; max-width: 72ch; }
  .cs-admin-template-section { margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-templates th, .table-list.cs-admin-templates td { text-align: left; vertical-align: middle; }
  .cs-admin-templates .table-list__actions > div { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; }
  .cs-admin-templates .table-list__actions form { margin: 0; }
  .cs-admin-choice--idle, .cs-admin-choice--idle:hover { background: #fff; color: rgb(21, 90, 191); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(21, 90, 191); }
  .cs-admin-template-name { font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .cs-admin-template-ico, .cs-admin-template-none { color: #3e4c5c; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cs-admin-note-form textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin: .375rem 0 .75rem; }
  .cs-admin-search { max-width: 72ch; }
  .cs-admin-search label { display: block; }
  .cs-admin-search input[type="text"] { display: block; width: 100%; margin: .375rem 0 .5rem; }
  .cs-admin-search .help-text { margin: 0 0 .75rem; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-roles th, .table-list.cs-admin-roles td { text-align: left; vertical-align: middle; }
  .cs-admin-role-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .cs-admin-role-actions form { margin: 0; }
  .cs-admin-dangling { color: #8a1c1c; font-weight: 600; }
  .cs-admin-sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
  .cs-admin-rules { list-style: disc; margin: .5rem 0 0 1.25rem; padding: 0; max-width: 72ch; }
  .cs-admin-rules li { margin-bottom: .5rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-import th, .table-list.cs-admin-import td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-import tbody th { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: #3e4c5c; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-import .cs-admin-import__num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cs-admin-import__errors { list-style: none; margin: .375rem 0 0; padding: 0; font-size: .875rem; color: #8a1c1c; }
  .cs-admin-import__errors li + li { margin-top: .25rem; }
  .table-list.cs-admin-import td:nth-child(2) { white-space: nowrap; }
  .cs-admin-import caption { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
  /* "What needs doing today" (admin home) */
  .cs-today__lead { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #3e4c5c; }
  .cs-today__group { margin: 0 0 2rem; }
  .cs-today__group-title { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
  .cs-today__group-hint { margin: 0 0 .75rem; color: #3e4c5c; font-size: .9375rem; }
  .cs-today__list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .cs-today__task { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: .75rem 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 .75rem; background: #fafbfc; border: 1px solid #e1e5ef; border-left: 4px solid #3e4c5c; }
  .cs-today__task--urgent { border-left-color: #a1161b; }
  .cs-today__task--waiting { border-left-color: rgb(21, 90, 191); }
  .cs-today__text { flex: 1 1 22rem; min-width: 0; }
  .cs-today__sentence { margin: 0; font-size: 1.0625rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; }
  .cs-today__record { margin: .25rem 0 0; color: #3e4c5c; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .cs-today__ref { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: #3e4c5c; font-size: .875rem; }
  .cs-today__hint { margin: .375rem 0 0; color: #3e4c5c; font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 64ch; }
  .cs-today__button { flex: 0 0 auto; min-height: 2.75rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cs-today__more { margin: 0; }
  .cs-today__done { padding: 2rem 1.25rem; background: #fafbfc; border: 1px solid #e1e5ef; border-left: 4px solid #1e6b3a; max-width: 48rem; }
  .cs-today__done-title { margin: 0 0 .25rem; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e6b3a; }
  .cs-today__done p { margin: 0; }
  .cs-today__details > summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(21, 90, 191); padding: .5rem 0; list-style: none; }
  .cs-today__details > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .cs-today__details > summary::before { content: "\25B8"; display: inline-block; width: 1.25rem; }
  .cs-today__details[open] > summary::before { content: "\25BE"; }
  .cs-today__details > summary:focus-visible, .cs-row-more > summary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid rgb(21, 90, 191); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .cs-today__details > :not(summary) { margin-top: .5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .cs-today__task { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .cs-today__text { flex: 0 0 auto; }
    .cs-today__button { width: 100%; }
  }
  /* Contract page and step indicator */
  .cs-show__meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem .75rem; align-items: center; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .cs-show__ref { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: #3e4c5c; }
  .cs-show__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .cs-show__actions form { margin: 0; }
  .cs-show__reason { margin-top: .75rem; max-width: 48rem; }
  .cs-show__more { margin-top: .5rem; }
  .cs-show__facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem 2rem; margin: 0; }
  .cs-show__fact dt { font-size: .875rem; color: #3e4c5c; margin: 0 0 .125rem; }
  .cs-show__fact dd { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cs-show__list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .cs-show__list li { margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .cs-show__facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .cs-show__fact--wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }
  .cs-steps-wrap { max-width: 56rem; }
  .cs-steps { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
  .cs-steps__step { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .625rem; color: #3e4c5c; font-size: .9375rem; }
  .cs-steps__marker { flex: 0 0 auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 1.75rem; height: 1.75rem; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #3e4c5c; background: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: .875rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cs-steps__step--done .cs-steps__marker { background: rgb(21, 90, 191); border-color: rgb(21, 90, 191); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); }
  .cs-steps__step--current { color: #111; font-weight: 700; }
  .cs-steps__step--current .cs-steps__marker { background: #111; border-color: #111; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #fff, 0 0 0 5px #111; }
  .cs-steps__step--stopped { color: #a1161b; font-weight: 700; }
  .cs-steps__step--stopped .cs-steps__marker { border-color: #a1161b; color: #a1161b; }
  .cs-steps__flag { display: inline-block; margin-left: .5rem; padding: 0 .5rem; font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 600; color: #6b3d00; background: #fff1d6; }
  .cs-steps__next { margin: 1rem 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem .75rem; align-items: baseline; line-height: 1.45; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .cs-steps { flex-direction: row; gap: 0; }
    .cs-steps__step { flex: 1 1 0; position: relative; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: .375rem; padding-right: .5rem; }
    .cs-steps__step + .cs-steps__step::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: .875rem; left: calc(-100% + 2.5rem); width: calc(100% - 3rem); height: 2px; background: #c4ccd8; }
    .cs-steps__step--done + .cs-steps__step::before, .cs-steps__step--current::before { background: rgb(21, 90, 191); }
  }
  /* Contracts list: filters and the per-row collapsed actions */
  .cs-admin-filters { margin: .5rem 0 .75rem; }
  .cs-admin-filter-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .cs-row-more { margin-top: .5rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .cs-row-more > summary { flex: 1 0 100%; cursor: pointer; font-size: .875rem; color: rgb(21, 90, 191); font-weight: 600; }
  .cs-row-more form { margin: 0; }
  .cs-show__reason summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(21, 90, 191); padding: .25rem 0; }
  /* The Civora credit (shared/_civora_credit) at the foot of the admin home. */
  .cs-credit { margin: 1.5rem 0 0; font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #5b576c; }
  .cs-credit__link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; color: #5b576c; text-decoration: none; }
  .cs-credit__link:hover { color: #232c63; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .18em; }
  .cs-credit__mark { flex: none; width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  /* Phones: header buttons wrap under the title, and the contracts list becomes one block per contract */
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .item_show__header { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; }
    .cs-admin-actions { flex-wrap: wrap; margin-left: 0; width: 100%; }
    .table-list.cs-rows thead { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
    .table-list.cs-rows, .table-list.cs-rows tbody, .table-list.cs-rows tr, .table-list.cs-rows td { display: block; width: 100%; }
    .table-list.cs-rows tr { padding: .75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e1e5ef; }
    .table-list.cs-rows td { text-align: left; padding: .125rem 0; border: 0; }
    .table-list.cs-rows td[data-label]::before { content: attr(data-label) ": "; color: #3e4c5c; font-size: .875rem; }
    .table-list.cs-rows td:empty { display: none; }
    .table-list.cs-rows td.table-list__actions { margin-top: .5rem; }
  }
</style>
  <% end %>
  <% if respond_to?(:snippets) %>
    <% snippets.add(:head, css) %>
  <% else %>
    <%= css %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
